OL,3,AUK to pay 'participation' fee to
OL,4,Adeliver EU deals
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK will pay a "participation fee"
OL,7,Fto the EU as part of the deals agreed
OL,8,Fby Andy Burnham, according to legal
OL,9,Fdocuments.
OL,11,FThe surcharge will go towards the
OL,12,Frunning costs of EU agencies and
OL,13,Fsystems required to deliver two of the
OL,14,Fagreements unveiled by the prime
OL,15,Fminister last week.
OL,17,FIt will be paid in addition to a
OL,18,Fcontribution towards costs that broadly
OL,19,Fmirrors how EU members contribute to
OL,20,Fthe bloc's shared budget, the documents
OL,21,Fshow.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
